# #5837, F2' (a5e2e2ef, #5837 comment 6654962443): a forward chain's stamp carries every
# forwarder on it, up to k, each attributed under the empty token.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestReforwardOmitsImmediateForwarder
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a re-forward's stamp omits its immediate forwarder, so at depth 2 L's foreignHigh misses the record and L advances past it unapplied
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithReforward = TRUE, WithOrphanForward = TRUE, WithMixedVersion = FALSE, MaxWindows = 0

--- FIND
Carried(h) == 1..h
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the stamp omits the immediate forwarder, hop h.
Carried(h) == 1..(h - 1)
--- END
